text = "[b]Tony The Pony[/b] is the elusive mastermind behind Omaplague, legendary Discord companion, and self-appointed Director of Global Pandemics.

[color=#ff7766]◆ Known Habitat:[/color]
Galloping across Hyprland at 240Hz with fractional scaling and zero frame drops.

[color=#ffaa44]◆ Origin Story:[/color]
Rumor has it Tony engineered the Omaplague pathogen after someone pinged @everyone in Discord for the third time in ten minutes.

[color=#44ddee]◆ Daily Routine:[/color]
Edits DNA codons directly in Neovim with zero plugins, sips quadruple espressos, and blames all mutation bugs on natural selection.

[color=#77ff77]◆ Official Medical Advice:[/color]
[i]\"If your planet catches a virus, simply reboot into recovery mode and delete systemd.\"[/i]

[color=#dd77ff]◆ Discord Perks:[/color]
Immune to hand sanitizer, 100% resistance to cure research, and never misses a meme release."

